      "properties": {
        "entityId": "northern-song",
        "startDate": "1041-02-01",
        "endDate": "1041-03-31",
        "order": 7,
        "segmentType": "counterattack",
        "name": {
          "zh": "镇戎军—好水川（任福追击中伏）",
          "en": "Zhenrongjun–Haoshuichuan (Ren Fu’s pursuit and ambush)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "庆历元年（1041）二月，元昊率十万众自天都山、折姜南下，沿瓦亭川直抵好水川，另遣偏师至怀远城诱敌。韩琦闻元昊谋寇渭州，急趋镇戎军，尽出守兵并募敢勇共一万八千人，命环庆路副都部署任福统率，令自镇戎军经怀远城、得胜寨至羊牧隆城出夏军之后。任福在怀远城、张家堡一带被诱，脱离辎重追击，二月十四日追至好水川，中伏大败，任福、桑怿等战死，士卒阵亡一万余人。原线起点作「西安」（今陕西西安），与战事无关，且日期误作 1040 年。路线为示意，怀远城、得胜寨、羊牧隆城只入正文。",
          "en": "In the second month of 1041 Li Yuanhao marched south from Tiandu shan and Zhejiang along the Wating river to Haoshuichuan, sending a detachment to feign an attack near Huaiyuan. Han Qi hurried to Zhenrongjun, turned out its garrison and raised 18,000 men under Ren Fu, ordering him to march via Huaiyuan and Desheng to Yangmulong and fall on the enemy’s rear. Ren Fu was lured forward at Huaiyuan and Zhangjiabao, abandoned his baggage and was caught at Haoshuichuan on 14 February; he and Sang Yi were killed and over 10,000 men died. The former line began at “Xi’an” (modern Xi’an city), unrelated to the campaign, and was dated 1040. The line is schematic; Huaiyuan, Desheng and Yangmulong appear only in the text."
        },
        "extensions": {
          "precision": "schematic"
        }
      }
    },
