        "segmentType": "advance",
        "name": {
          "zh": "漠北—野狐岭（成吉思汗伐金）",
          "en": "North of the desert–Yehuling (Chinggis Khan’s campaign against Jin)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "1211 年三月，成吉思汗自漠北率军南下伐金，经汪古部领地入塞；七月与金军主力战于野狐岭（今河北万全北），金军大败，蒙古军随即南下围攻中都。原线起点作「草原」（约北纬 42°），与 1209 年攻西夏段相距 190km 而无前置；现改由漠北出发，与 1209 年出师地相接。路线为示意。",
          "en": "In the third month of 1211 Chinggis Khan marched south from north of the desert against Jin, passing through Ongud territory; in the seventh month he destroyed the Jin main army at Yehuling (north of modern Wanquan, Hebei) and moved on to besiege Zhongdu. The former line began at a vague “steppe” point near 42°N, 190 km from the 1209 Western Xia campaign with no precedent; it now starts north of the desert, linking to the 1209 starting point. The line is schematic."
        },
        "extensions": {
          "precision": "schematic"
        }
